{
  "name": "Store and share a PDF with dosya.dev",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Store and share a PDF\n\nA PDF is uploaded to dosya.dev, a 7-day share link is created, the link is emailed, and the webhook answers with the link.\n\n**Setup**\n1. **Upload PDF** and **Create Share Link**: choose your dosya.dev API credential, then a **Workspace** (and a **Folder** for the upload).\n2. **Email the Link**: choose an SMTP credential and set the From address.\n3. Activate, then test with:\n```\ncurl -X POST --data-binary @invoice.pdf \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/pdf\" \\\n  \"https://YOUR-N8N/webhook/dosya-store-pdf?filename=invoice-1042.pdf&email=client@example.com\"\n```\n\nIn your own workflow, replace **Receive PDF** with the step that generates the PDF, and connect it to **Upload PDF**. Upload reads the file from the binary field named in **Input Data Field Name** (here `data`).",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "b2e1d4c3-0002-4d2f-8b20-000000000001",
      "name": "Setup b2e1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "dosya-store-pdf",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2e1d4c3-0002-4d2f-8b20-000000000002",
      "name": "Receive PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        80
      ],
      "webhookId": "b2e1d4c3-0002-4d2f-8b20-0000000000aa"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "file",
        "operation": "upload",
        "workspace": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "folder": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "binaryPropertyName": "data",
        "fileName": "={{ $json.query.filename || 'document-' + $now.toFormat('yyyy-LL-dd-HHmmss') + '.pdf' }}"
      },
      "id": "b2e1d4c3-0002-4d2f-8b20-000000000003",
      "name": "Upload PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-dosya.dosya",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "shareLink",
        "operation": "create",
        "workspace": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "shareTarget": "file",
        "file": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $json.id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "expiresInDays": 7
        }
      },
      "id": "b2e1d4c3-0002-4d2f-8b20-000000000004",
      "name": "Create Share Link",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-dosya.dosya",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "files@example.com",
        "toEmail": "={{ $('Receive PDF').item.json.query.email }}",
        "subject": "=Your document: {{ $('Upload PDF').item.json.name }}",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "=Hello,\n\nYour document is ready to download:\n{{ $json.url }}\n\nThe link works until {{ $json.expires_at ? DateTime.fromISO($json.expires_at).toFormat('d LLLL yyyy') : 'it is revoked' }}.\n",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2e1d4c3-0002-4d2f-8b20-000000000005",
      "name": "Email the Link",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        720,
        80
      ],
      "webhookId": "b2e1d4c3-0002-4d2f-8b20-0000000000bb"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { file_id: $('Upload PDF').item.json.id, name: $('Upload PDF').item.json.name, share_url: $('Create Share Link').item.json.url, expires_at: $('Create Share Link').item.json.expires_at } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2e1d4c3-0002-4d2f-8b20-000000000006",
      "name": "Respond with Link",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        960,
        80
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Receive PDF": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Upload PDF",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Upload PDF": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create Share Link",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Create Share Link": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Email the Link",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Email the Link": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond with Link",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "tags": []
}
